software newly written for the site, including drawings written as inline SVG code in src/ components) and,
since 2026-09-25, to the example code in examples/ (including the .meta.yaml files next to the examples).
Learning materials (content/), image files (public/images/), the redacted handouts (public/teacher/handouts/)
and documentation are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSE-CONTENT.md). Third-party materials
and open-source libraries listed individually in sources.yaml (for example, files in third-party/ folders,
including those under examples/) are excluded and remain under their original terms.
